  << /ActualText (Serve as lead developer and project manager for production\055grade XR training systems used by Fortune 500 clients\054 owning the full technical lifecycle\024from infrastructure design and implementation to cross\055functional coordination and final delivery across VR\054 mobile\054 and web platforms\056\nSpearheaded a 33\045 reduction in XR development time through improved pipeline automation\054 optimized asset workflows\054 and enhanced team coordination\024while consistently maintaining high customer satisfaction and delivery quality\056\nLead all technical stakeholder communications\054 translating complex XR development strategies into accessible guidance for clients unfamiliar with immersive technologies\073 serve as primary point of contact for onboarding\054 planning\054 and ongoing support\056\nCollaborated with cross\055functional teams to implement custom interaction interfaces and immersive UI components\054 optimizing both client\055specific features and shared infrastructure\056\nProvided technical leadership through code reviews\054 mentorship\054 and architectural guidance\054 ensuring high code quality\054 maintainability\054 and extensibility\056)
